            "description": "<p>Component representing a folder icon.</p>\n<p>To use the <code>FolderIconComponent</code>, you need first to import the component in your module</p>\n<div><pre class=\"line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-ts\">import { FolderIconComponent } from &#39;&#64;alfresco/adf-hx-content-services/icons&#39;;\n&#64;NgModule({\n    imports: [\n        FolderIconComponent,\n        ...\n    ],\n   [...]\n})\nexport class AppModule {}</code></pre></div><p>Then use it in your Angular template as shown in the example below:</p>\n<div><pre class=\"line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-html\">&lt;hxp-folder-icon [isExpanded]=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/hxp-folder-icon&gt;</code></pre></div>",
            "rawdescription": "\n\nComponent representing a folder icon.\n\nTo use the `FolderIconComponent`, you need first to import the component in your module\n```ts\nimport { FolderIconComponent } from '@alfresco/adf-hx-content-services/icons';\n@NgModule({\n    imports: [\n        FolderIconComponent,\n        ...\n    ],\n   [...]\n})\nexport class AppModule {}\n```\n\nThen use it in your Angular template as shown in the example below:\n```html\n<hxp-folder-icon [isExpanded]=\"true\"></hxp-folder-icon>\n```",
            "type": "component",
            "sourceCode": "import { Component, Input } from '@angular/core';\nimport { MimeTypeIconComponent } from '../mime-type-icon/mime-type-icon.component';\nimport { DefaultIcon } from '../configs/icons.config';\n\n/**\n * Component representing a folder icon.\n *\n * To use the `FolderIconComponent`, you need first to import the component in your module\n * ```ts\n * import { FolderIconComponent } from '@alfresco/adf-hx-content-services/icons';\n * @NgModule({\n *     imports: [\n *         FolderIconComponent,\n *         ...\n *     ],\n *    [...]\n * })\n * export class AppModule {}\n * ```\n *\n * Then use it in your Angular template as shown in the example below:\n * @example\n * <hxp-folder-icon [isExpanded]=\"true\"></hxp-folder-icon>\n */\n@Component({\n    selector: 'hxp-folder-icon',\n    templateUrl: './folder-icon.component.html',\n    standalone: true,\n    imports: [MimeTypeIconComponent],\n})\nexport class FolderIconComponent {\n    /**\n     * Indicates whether the folder is expanded.\n     * @type {boolean}\n     */\n    @Input()\n    isExpanded = false;\n\n    readonly folderIcon: DefaultIcon = 'folder';\n    readonly openFolderIcon: DefaultIcon = 'openFolder';\n}\n",
            "assetsDirs": [],
            "styleUrlsData": "",
            "stylesData": "",
            "templateData": "<hxp-mime-type-icon\n    [mimeType]=\"isExpanded ? openFolderIcon : folderIcon\"\n></hxp-mime-type-icon>\n"
        },
